     * `promotional_text`, `support_url`, `marketing_url`, `whats_new`).
     *
     * # Errors
     * [`StackError::PendingAgreements`] on a pending-agreements 403,
     * [`StackError::Http`] on any other non-2xx page, [`StackError::Decode`] on
